1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,871
[Rehab Therapist
Seung-hyun Park]

2
00:00:04,503 --> 00:00:07,047
We're officially a team now.

3
00:00:07,048 --> 00:00:09,134
How does it feel?

4
00:00:09,134 --> 00:00:12,137
Like a dream. Truly.

5
00:00:12,470 --> 00:00:14,639
Congrats, Therapist Park.

6
00:00:14,639 --> 00:00:16,932
Thank you, Therapist Yun.

7
00:00:16,933 --> 00:00:19,853
We're really
teammates now, huh?

8
00:00:23,106 --> 00:00:25,650
Now we can help
even more people.

9
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:29,320
I'll give it my all.

10
00:00:33,033 --> 00:00:34,868
Hello

11
00:00:34,868 --> 00:00:37,871
I'm Seung-hyun Park
your therapist.

12
00:00:38,246 --> 00:00:39,831
I used to be an athlete too.

13
00:00:39,831 --> 00:00:42,834
I had to give up on my dream
because of an injury

14
00:00:42,959 --> 00:00:45,670
but I've found a new one.

15
00:00:45,670 --> 00:00:47,922
Let's get through this
together.

16
00:01:07,650 --> 00:01:09,652
Thank you, Ji-sung.

17
00:01:09,652 --> 00:01:12,655
I could get through it all
because you were there.

18
00:01:13,948 --> 00:01:17,035
We got through it
because we were together.

19
00:01:19,329 --> 00:01:23,666
Let's keep going, together.

20
00:01:24,250 --> 00:01:26,419
Always.
